sequenceDiagram
    actor Requester
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant Supplier as Supplier Service
    participant Users as User Service
    participant Rating as Rating stub
    participant Credit as Credit Service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Requester->>Orders: POST /api/v1/orders
    Orders->>Orders: check expiry and delivery times
    Orders->>Users: GET /internal/users/{userId}/telegram
    Users-->>Orders: telegram handle
    Orders->>Supplier: GET /api/v1/supplier/{pickupId}
    Supplier-->>Orders: approved place
    Orders->>Supplier: GET /api/v1/supplier/{dropoffId}
    Supplier-->>Orders: approved place
    Orders->>Rating: rating for requester
    Rating-->>Orders: 5.0
    Orders->>Credit: POST /api/v1/credit/reserve
    Credit-->>Orders: reserved
    Orders->>DB: insert CREATED order, log, alert, status outbox
    Orders-->>Requester: 201 CREATED
    Note over Orders,Credit: If the insert fails, POST /api/v1/credit/release returns the reservation
